# Cursor Rules — Khidmah Pro (خدمة برو)

All work in this workspace is strictly governed by the Master Constitution in `AGENTS.md`.

1. **Read `AGENTS.md` first** before inspecting or changing any file.
2. **Official Identity:** **خدمة برو / Khidmah Pro** (`page.props.app_name` on frontend, `config('app.name_ar')` / `config('app.name')` on backend). Do not use `Carag`.
3. **Follow the Specialist Docs (no duplicate rules here):**
   - `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — Backend layers, transactions, and Single Source of Truth
   - `docs/COMPONENTS.md` — Official `App*` / `Common*` registry and deprecated components
   - `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` — `resources/js/Design/tokens.css`, `IBM Plex Sans Arabic`, RTL/Dark rules
   - `docs/I18N_RULES.md` — `t('...')` / `__('...')` and `scripts/check-i18n-parity.mjs`
   - `docs/SECURITY.md` — `TenantScoped`, `CenterScoped`, Policies, secure uploads, and audit logging
   - `docs/TESTING.md` — Quality gates, baseline failure rules, and ADR format
4. **Scope & Git Discipline:** Only modify files required for the approved task. Never revert user or peer-agent changes.
5. **Mandatory Verification:** Run the relevant quality gates from `docs/TESTING.md` before reporting completion.
